rushing session. This is a great way to bond and connect with your cat. And it of course minimizes hairballs. I'm obsessed with this particular brush because you just press a button and it releases cat fur. So it's nice and hairball free for the next use. I love to swap out Sweetie's water every day. Even if it's full, this will minimize that slimy film that forms and prevents any germs. And not sure about your cat, but Sweetie loves ice cubes in her water. Oh, and she also has to always have her fresh water fountain going. Time for her midday sun. No day would be complete without a little afternoon snack. Sweetie is obsessed with the chicken temptations. And side note, if I'm not home, I'll use my Furbo to release treats and keep Sweetie happy and occupied. And if it's movie night, I'll make sure to whip out Sweetie's favorite blanket. And this one always brings the biscuits. And then when it's bedtime, I always reach for my meow button. And this always brings Sweetie over and it helps us wind down for bed. Okay, mostly wind down.", "is_relevant": false}, {"shortCode": "DbHAZU2BUD6", "url": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DbHAZU2BUD6/", "caption": "Easy ways to instantly transform your kitchen \u2728 kitchen runner is from @vmathome and lazy susan, breadbox and caddy are from @yamazakihome", "timestamp": "2026-07-22T21:02:12.000Z", "videoDuration": 54.82, "videoPlayCount": 2727, "videoViewCount": 112, "likesCount": 77, "commentsCount": 0, "displayUrl": "https://scontent-yyz1-1.cdninstagram.com/v/t51.82787-15/771822961_18123290272828197_2330381055633421213_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e15_tt6&_nc_ht=scontent-yyz1-1.cdninstagram.com&_nc_cat=109&_nc_oc=Q6cZ2gFJ2RletyMeRu2v1mEwbnXMLvRM9hyRLrjrhQnRxKPaBhetlsw8kXTwdk_j1EXBr7c&_nc_ohc=jBtFey5FfuoQ7kNvwEgWnZ4&_nc_gid=DRQZxEJOXukonkD1gVWKPw&edm=ADp7STQBAAAA&ccb=7-5&oh=00_AQHvSecJ2_zUqyzsShSEuSBR2RtiUsYzLuwKZy90vFByxg&oe=6A877B1D&_nc_sid=c6f216", "videoUrl": "https://scontent-yyz1-1.cdninstagram.com/o1/v/t2/f2/m86/AQM3LOSeK1xJ-edOYZitEvYo